event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 解题步骤\n\n**约束条件：**\n- "}              }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"狼和羊单独在一起 → 狼吃羊\n- 羊和白菜单独在一起 → 羊吃白菜\n- 农夫不在场时，上"}        }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"述情况绝对不能发生\n\n**正确步骤（共7步）：**\n\n| 步骤 | 农夫携带 | 河这岸剩余 "}             }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"| 河对岸 |\n|------|---------|-----------|--------|\n| 起始 | - | 狼、羊、白菜 | 无 |\n| 1 "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"| 羊 → | 狼、白菜 | 羊 |\n| 2 | 空手 ← | 狼、白菜 | 羊 |\n| 3 | 狼 → | 白菜 | "}             }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"羊、狼 |\n| 4 | 羊 ← | 白菜、羊 | 狼 |\n| 5 | 白菜 → | 羊 | 狼、白菜 |\n| 6 | 空手 ← | 羊 | "}   }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"狼、白菜 |\n| 7 | 羊 → | 无 | 狼、羊、白菜 |\n\n## 为什么不能先运狼？\n\n如果第一步先运狼过河，此时河这岸只"}       }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"剩下 **羊和白菜**，且农夫不在场——**羊会吃掉白菜**，导致失败。\n\n**关键逻辑：**\n-"}            }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" 羊是唯一\"双面威胁\"角色：既会被狼吃，又会吃白菜\n- 因此必须**第一个"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"运走羊**，才能保证留在原岸的狼和白菜互不"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"侵犯（狼不吃白菜）\n- 这也是第4步要把羊运回来的原因：先送"}  }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"狼过去后，若不把羊带回，河对岸就会剩下\"狼+羊\"，狼会吃羊\n\n**核"}  }

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"心策略：** 始终确保\"羊\"不与\"狼\"或\"白菜\"在无人看管的情况下独处。"}         }

